priority: 1000
max-visits: 1
face-image: img/CCF_Convention.jpg
on-arrival: {!
    var mid_panel = document.getElementById('mid_panel');
    var content = document.getElementById('content');
    var tools = document.getElementById('tools_wrapper'); 

    var left_sidebar = document.getElementById('stats_sidebar'); 
    var right_sidebar = document.getElementById('stats_sidebar_right'); 

    Q.old_mid_panel_margin = mid_panel.style.margin;

    left_sidebar.style.display = 'none'; 
    right_sidebar.style.display = 'none';
    mid_panel.style.margin = '0 0';

    content.style.maxWidth = '100em';
    content.style.width = '50em';

    var williamsHTML = `<div id="GHW" class="face-figure" style="position: absolute; left: 0px;"><img class="face-img" src="img/portraits/WilliamsHaraGeorge.jpg"></div>`;
    mid_panel.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend', williamsHTML);

!} 
on-departure: {!
    var mid_panel = document.getElementById('mid_panel');
    var content = document.getElementById('content');
    var tools = document.getElementById('tools_wrapper'); 

    var left_sidebar = document.getElementById('stats_sidebar'); 
    var right_sidebar = document.getElementById('stats_sidebar_right'); 

    left_sidebar.style.display = ''; 
    right_sidebar.style.display = '';

    // Restore original panel margin
    mid_panel.style.margin = Q.old_mid_panel_margin;

    // Clear the inline overrides entirely so media queries take back control
    content.style.maxWidth = '';
    content.style.width = '';
!}

= Selection of our President

The time has come for the CCF(SS) to select a President. Five distinguished party members have been nominated though 3 have already declined to run. That leaves 2, George Williams and Major James Coldwell. 

George Williams is the architect behind the Saskatchewan farmers's entrance into politics. Having served as President of the UFC(SS), he steered the organization against endorsing the disorganized and ineffective PPS, instead attempting to create his own Farmer's party. He is a radical agrarian socialist and does not back away from criticizing Capitalism for the plight of the workers and farmers. 

Major James Coldwell is the moderate former leader of the ILP and founder of the urban wing of the PPS. As a school principal, he championed teacher's labour rights. Coldwell is a strong public speaker and would be able to draw large crowds in the cities. He holds a grudge against Williams for not endorsing the PPS, contributing to an embarrassing election defeat. 

- @GeorgeWilliams: George Williams will surely lead the CCF(SS) to victory.
- @Coldwell: Coldwell will surely lead the CCF(SS) to victory. 

@GeorgeWilliams 
